{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Kotobuki town</strong>, a quaint community currently being gobbled up acre by acre by dastardly big-city landsharks. It\u2019s also your new home. Do you have what it takes to bring the locals together and save their beloved sushi bar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by slice-of-life anime, <i>Sushi Ben</i> is a sweet, funny and bombastic narrative adventure about finding your feet in a new town (and sticking it to landlords while you\u2019re at it).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.poster.avif?t=1756960012\" width=620 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.webm?t=1756960012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Featuring a gorgeous seaside setting, eye-popping 3D manga panels, a fully voiced cast of colorful characters, and plenty of minigames \u2013 fishing, archery, dog walking, and even ghost hunting...!?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With narrative talents of <strong>Hato Moa</strong> (<i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>) and voice acting by <strong>Laura Post</strong> (<i>Little Witch Academia</i>), <strong>Ryan Colt Levy</strong> (<i>Chainsaw Man</i>), <strong>AJ Beckles</strong> (<i>Dandadan</i>) and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.poster.avif?t=1756960012\" width=620 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/76e85c7f5913b761f2f4d03fdba52525.webm?t=1756960012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>interactive anime story</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop out <strong>manga panels</strong> bring the tale to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful cast</strong> of small town characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome</strong> and <strong>over-the-top</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours of <strong>story quests!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ hours of <strong>mini-games</strong> - fishing, archery, ghost hunting and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in <strong>flatscreen</strong> and <strong>VR</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>voice acting</strong> from a stacked 20+ cast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative by the creator of <i>Hatoful Boyfriend</i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/6023eee5a0f4f283784a861fcebea784.avif?t=1756960012\" width=620 height=152 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2419240?t=1756960012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/3bab972e6c99dd73bf8cb7b7d2618222cba30035/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756960012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/2480efda2c909303b1a74d5b956ead0797b8ab71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756960012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/2480efda2c909303b1a74d5b956ead0797b8ab71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756960012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"VR Support","id":31},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2773840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83c\udfaeNon-VR Mode!!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/211c7be19a5679095e347151cb0e98d5.avif?t=1756960012\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sushi Ben</strong> has can be played with VR or without! Try  the new <strong>Non-VR</strong> demo to see if the game is for you!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Kotobuki town</strong>, a quaint community currently being gobbled up acre by acre by dastardly big-city landsharks. It\u2019s also your new home. Do you have what it takes to bring the locals together and save their beloved sushi bar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by slice-of-life anime, <i>Sushi Ben</i> is a sweet, funny and bombastic narrative adventure about finding your feet in a new town (and sticking it to landlords while you\u2019re at it).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419240/extras/f007acaa950fe7b6bdfaa1a051150e79.poster.avif?t=1756960012\" width=620 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.